Story: Racing the computer pilots from the station
  As a pilot with a TX15
  I want the computer pilots to start the race as I do
  So that the race is fair

  Start a race in the sim. All the planes stand on the field, and nobody can arm before GO.
  At GO, you and the computer pilots arm, take off and fly to the course.

  Scenario: Wait for GO, then go
    When the pilot starts a race
    Then the game clock is counting down
    And the opponents are on the ground
    When the arm switch is on
    Then the vehicle is disarmed
    When the countdown ends
    Then the vehicle is armed
    And the opponents are flying
